---
title: Tell us you have moved
order: 2
summary: A form with no labels, no hints and an error message that tells you nothing. Then the same form, done properly.
scenario: You work on a support desk. Margaret has phoned in to change her address and you are filling the form in for her while she waits on the line. She is 63, she has moved to Swansea, and she has already been passed between two departments.
tasks:
  - Fill the form in with Margaret's details exactly as she gives them to you.
  - Submit it. Keep going until it is accepted, and count how many attempts it takes.
  - Now switch to the accessible version and do exactly the same thing.
time: 10 minutes
barrier: Unlabelled controls and unusable error messages
criterion: WCAG 2.2 &mdash; <a href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/labels-or-instructions.html">3.3.2 Labels or Instructions</a> and <a href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/error-suggestion.html">3.3.3 Error Suggestion</a>
script: forms.js
---

<aside class="callout">
  <h2>Margaret's details</h2>
  <p>Read these out as she would say them. Do not tidy them up.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Name:</strong> Margaret Okonkwo-Bell</li>
    <li><strong>Date of birth:</strong> 3rd of July, 1962</li>
    <li><strong>New address:</strong> 14 Brynmill Terrace, Swansea</li>
    <li><strong>Postcode:</strong> &ldquo;S A 1, 5 L N&rdquo;</li>
  </ul>
</aside>

<section class="activity" aria-labelledby="activity-heading">
  <div class="activity__bar">
    <h2 id="activity-heading">Change of address</h2>
    <fieldset class="mode-toggle" data-mode-toggle="form-mode">
      <legend>Version</legend>
      <div class="mode-toggle__options">
        <input type="radio" name="form-mode" id="form-mode-broken" value="broken" checked>
        <label for="form-mode-broken">With the barrier</label>
        <input type="radio" name="form-mode" id="form-mode-fixed" value="fixed">
        <label for="form-mode-fixed">Accessible</label>
      </div>
    </fieldset>
  </div>

  <div class="activity__body">
    <p class="visually-hidden" data-mode-status role="status"></p>

    <!-- Deliberately inaccessible. Announced as such so that anyone using a
         screen reader knows the barriers below are the exercise, not a bug. -->
    <div data-mode="broken" role="group" aria-label="Version with the barrier. This form is deliberately inaccessible.">
      <div class="demo demo--form-broken">
        <h3>Update your details</h3>
        <form id="broken-form" novalidate>
          <input type="text" id="bf-name" placeholder="Full name *" maxlength="15">

          <p class="bf-dob-text">DOB *</p>
          <div class="bf-dob">
            <input type="text" id="bf-day" maxlength="2">
            <input type="text" id="bf-month" maxlength="2">
            <input type="text" id="bf-year" maxlength="4">
          </div>

          <input type="text" id="bf-address" placeholder="Address *">
          <input type="text" id="bf-postcode" placeholder="Postcode *">
          <input type="text" id="bf-phone" placeholder="Contact number">

          <p class="bf-error" id="bf-error" hidden>Sorry, there was a problem with your form. Please check your answers and try again.</p>

          <div class="bf-actions">
            <button type="reset" class="bf-btn">Clear</button>
            <button type="submit" class="bf-btn">Submit</button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
      <p class="tally">Attempts: <strong id="broken-attempts">0</strong></p>
    </div>

    <div data-mode="fixed" hidden>
      <div class="demo demo--form-fixed">
        <h3>Update your details</h3>

        <div id="ff-summary" class="error-summary" tabindex="-1" hidden
             role="alert" aria-labelledby="ff-summary-title">
          <h4 id="ff-summary-title">There is a problem</h4>
          <ul id="ff-summary-list"></ul>
        </div>

        <form id="fixed-form" novalidate>
          <p class="form-intro">All questions are required unless marked optional.</p>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="ff-name">Full name</label>
            <span class="hint" id="ff-name-hint">Including any hyphens or apostrophes, as it appears on your bank card.</span>
            <p class="field-error" id="ff-name-error" hidden></p>
            <input type="text" id="ff-name" name="name" autocomplete="name"
                   aria-describedby="ff-name-hint">
          </div>

          <fieldset class="field field--fieldset">
            <legend>Date of birth</legend>
            <span class="hint" id="ff-dob-hint">For example, 3 7 1962</span>
            <p class="field-error" id="ff-dob-error" hidden></p>
            <div class="ff-dob">
              <span class="date-part">
                <label for="ff-day">Day</label>
                <input type="text" inputmode="numeric" id="ff-day" name="day"
